		{"id":"1d89cee9c0a06b53","type":"text","text":"Honey,\nJust 10 minutes is not fine.\nStaying with you through the night.\nI hope you don't mind.\nI swear I won't bite.\nSnuggling with you feels just right.\nNothing more, just you and I.\nI just want to hold you tight.\nDon't want to break line of sight.\n\n When the sky starts to fade.\n I hope I can stay awake.\n Won't be long it will take.\n I hope a hug is okay.\n There's one thing I hate.\n I can't staying up late.\n And time does not wait.\n Hope you don't mean what you say.\n \n A~\n I won't let you go,\n It's a promise I'll remember.\n Always together\n be with you forever.\n \n A~\n I know this comes out of the blue,\n there is no undo.\n I want to tell you ZUTO AISHITERU \n \n Baka\n 10 minutes, don't waste my time.\n You sure that you can survive ?\n Don't be sus and you'll be fine.\n You better don't bite.\n Seriously, what's on your mind ?\n You better know where's the line.\n Don't scratch me and you'll be fine.\n But please don't leave me behind.\n \n Every single day, many times I have said\n \"I AM NOT YOUR PREY\"\n please be gentle FOR GOD SAKE\n There's one thing I hate\n Can't control my heart rate,\n and time does not wait.\n I hope you mean what you said.\n \n A~\n Staying together was a promise we're way younger\n How in the world do you even remember\n \n A~\n This is a secret,\n I guess it's fine to be with you.\n But don't make me to tell you\n \"JUST SHUT UP YOU FOOL\" \n \n A~\n I won't let you go, It's a promise I'll remember.\n Always together, be with you forever. \n \n A~\n Staying together was a promise we're way younger\n How in the world do you even remember \n \n A~\n I know this comes out of the blue,\n there is no undo.\n I want to tell you ZUTO AISHITERU\n \n A~\n This is a secret, I guess it's fine to be with you.\n But don't make me to tell you\n \"JUST SHUT UP YOU FOOL\"\n \n A~\n {XR} I won't let you go, It's a promise I'll remember. Always together, be with you forever. \n {Miku} Staying together was a promise we're way younger How in the world do you even remember\n \n {XR} After all of these days and months\n {Miku} You already know\n {XR} I just want to be with you\n {Miku} Guess I have to stick with you\n {XR} Until gravity collapses the entire universe\n {Miku} You sure can last longer than a million years ?\n {XR} This is not something new\n {Miku} Why do I have to tell you ?\n {XR} Just want you to know\n {Miku} don't you already know ?\n {MIXKRU} ZUTO AISHITERU","x":-1260,"y":495,"width":420,"height":1645},
		{"id":"c030ae689e8775e8","type":"text","text":"kalæj-hani\nTæræf TaKla-dæ-Ri-ni Tæraf Svæki \"Just\" kiamasæno \"fine\"\nTæræf krut-\"Stay\" Tæraf Svæk \"with\" Koi-lina | \"through\" TaKaka-na-Ræ-lo Svok\nKoi-nito krut-\"hope\" Tæræf Koi-lina \"dont\" \"mind\" Tæraf\nKoi-nito krut-\"swear\" Tæræf Koi-nito \"wont\" krut-\"bite\" Tæraf\nTæræf krut-\"Snugg\" Svæk \"with\" Koi-lina Svok Tæraf krut-\"cause\" Tæræf Koi-nito krut-\"feels\" \"right\" Svæk just Svok Tæraf\nno other things, just you and I = \nKoini klæj-want svik klæj-just Tæræf Koini klæj-Krut-hold svik klæj-tight Koili Tæraf\nDon't want to break line of sight.\n\n When the sky starts to fade.\n I hope I can stay awake.\n Won't be long it will take.\n I hope a hug is okay.\n There's one thing I hate.\n I can't staying up late.\n And time does not wait.\n Hope you don't mean what you say.\n \n A~\n I won't let you go,\n It's a promise I'll remember.\n Always together\n be with you forever.\n \n A~\n I know this comes out of the blue,\n there is no undo.\n I want to tell you ZUTO AISHITERU \n \n Baka\n 10 minutes, don't waste my time.\n You sure that you can survive ?\n Don't be sus and you'll be fine.\n You better don't bite.\n Seriously, what's on your mind ?\n You better know where's the line.\n Don't scratch me and you'll be fine.\n But please don't leave me behind.\n \n Every single day, many times I have said\n \"I AM NOT YOUR PREY\"\n please be gentle FOR GOD SAKE\n There's one thing I hate\n Can't control my heart rate,\n and time does not wait.\n I hope you mean what you said.\n \n A~\n Staying together was a promise we're way younger\n How in the world do you even remember\n \n A~\n This is a secret,\n I guess it's fine to be with you.\n But don't make me to tell you\n \"JUST SHUT UP YOU FOOL\" \n \n A~\n I won't let you go, It's a promise I'll remember.\n Always together, be with you forever. \n \n A~\n Staying together was a promise we're way younger\n How in the world do you even remember \n \n A~\n I know this comes out of the blue,\n there is no undo.\n I want to tell you ZUTO AISHITERU\n \n A~\n This is a secret, I guess it's fine to be with you.\n But don't make me to tell you\n \"JUST SHUT UP YOU FOOL\"\n \n A~\n {XR} I won't let you go, It's a promise I'll remember. Always together, be with you forever. \n {Miku} Staying together was a promise we're way younger How in the world do you even remember\n \n {XR} After all of these days and months\n {Miku} You already know\n {XR} I just want to be with you\n {Miku} Guess I have to stick with you\n {XR} Until gravity collapses the entire universe\n {Miku} You sure can last longer than a million years ?\n {XR} This is not something new\n {Miku} Why do I have to tell you ?\n {XR} Just want you to know\n {Miku} don't you already know ?\n {MIXKRU} ZUTO AISHITERU","x":-760,"y":495,"width":940,"height":1645},
		{"id":"014f3911a7c22b07","type":"text","text":"# preposition for spacetime / verb\n\n## key idea\npreposition for position : on, beside, under ...\npreposition for time : before, now, after ...\npreposition for verb : across, through\n\n## vocabs to tackle\n- through\n- across","x":940,"y":440,"width":480,"height":340},
		{"id":"d7a55680e0ece22c","type":"text","text":"# Verb to be and not to be and model verbs (can, may, should)\n\n## Key Idea\n\"verb\" is /Krut/ -> /Ku/\n\"not\" is /Zo/,\n\"event stem\" is /Sæto/\n\n/Ku-sæto/ = \"do\"\ncan attach time info to turn it into \"did\" and \"will\"\nto turn it into negative, attach /Zo/ after /Ku/\n>[!example] verbs\n>/Ku-kia-kiæf-pi/ = \"cut\"\n>/KuZo-kia-kiæf-pi/ = \"didn't cut\" / \"don't cut\" / \"won't cut\"\n>/KuZo-kia-kiæf-pi Svik Ta-Kaka/ = /Zo-kiæf-pi Svik Takaka/ = \"won't cut\"\n\n\n\n\n\n","x":940,"y":820,"width":640,"height":540},
		{"id":"e82a91e8a393eaa8","type":"text","text":">[! warning] Crop /Krut/ ?\n>maybe /Sæyanæ-Krut/ -> /SæKrut/ -> /SKrut/ -> /Krut/ -> /Ku/\n\n","x":1660,"y":991,"width":400,"height":198},
		{"id":"b9f925a5264d1c83","x":-69,"y":-386,"width":589,"height":406,"type":"text","text":"\n| kla | s               | z             | c             |\n| --- | --------------- | ------------- | ------------- |\n| a   | /klasa/ : add   | /klaza/ : mul | /klaca/ : exp |\n| æ   | /klasæ/ : minus | /klazæ/ : div | /klacæ/ : mod |\n\neg:\n\n```\n\n(-b+sqrt(b^2 - 4ac))/(2a)\n(-b+Δ(?,2,(b^2 - 4ac)))\n(-b+Δ(?,2,(Δ(b,2,?) - (4*a*c))))/(2*a)\n\n\n\n\n```"},
